abstract: >
  One self-contained Python file, um.py, whose only runtime input is the digit 1. It derives the
  chain beta = alpha*sqrt(e), materializes and builds an embedded Lean 4 + mathlib kernel (593 formal
  files, 4699 audited theorems, axioms in {propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound}, zero sorry), runs the
  pre-registered rites of nature, and emits its own bilingual article (PT/EN, PDF and TXT). Quantum
  gravity is PROVED as a formal model (the root of the proof tree, the_root_of_the_proof_tree) and NOT
  confirmed by nature (NOT_FALSIFIED within the local bulk at available sensitivity). The seal
  (um_absoluto_selo.json) is the truth of the repository.
